<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38528" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεισοδ-ιώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>episodic, incoherent,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῦθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Po.</u>
					1451b34
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἔοικεν ἡ φύσις ἐ. οὖσα ὥσπερ
					μοχθηρὰ τραγῳδία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1090b19
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				279
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ascl.
					<u>in Metaph.</u>
					142.28
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεισόδιος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i>adventitious,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ γὰρ ἔξωθεν ἐπίκτητος οὐδ᾽ ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Sent.</u>
					36
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. καὶ δευτέραν συνεπομένην ὑπόστασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Protr.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. καὶ συμβεβηκός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. καὶ ἀλλαχόθεν ἐφῆκον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>Inst.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			.</div>
